# The bridge token: the secret that lets the site sync write the league's dynasties to the website.
# Installed as /etc/fcs-league/bridge.env, owned by root, mode 600 (only root can read it).
# systemd reads it and hands it to ONE service: the site sync (fcs-league-sync), which listens on no port.
# The game service that faces the internet does not get this token. It has its own, in registry.env.
#
# NEVER commit the real file, paste it in chat, or copy it into league.env.
# It is the same value as BRIDGE_TOKEN on the Worker (wrangler secret) and "token" in ~/.ncaa-bridge/config.json
# on the PC that runs the league today.
#
# One line, no quotes, nothing after the value:
NCAA_BRIDGE_TOKEN=paste-the-token-here
